Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森的农场 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:12.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}第30集 挥霍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:41.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}时间来到了七月中旬
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:41.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We had now reached the middle of July.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在蔚蓝的天空下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:45.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And under a canopy of blue skies,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:48.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}作物看起来长势良好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:48.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the crops appeared to be coming along nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}过不了多久 我们就要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:52.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Soon then, we'd all be rolling up our sleeves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.04,0:00:56.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}卷起袖子 开始收割了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.04,0:00:56.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and getting down to the job of harvesting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我无法期待收割季的到来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:07.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I couldn't look forward to that, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:11.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我得集中精力把酒吧开起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:11.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because I had to focus on getting the pub open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.12,0:01:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}右边 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.12,0:01:15.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:18.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}右边 工作 对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:18.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right: jobs. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:21.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我希望在八月银行假期前开张
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:21.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I wanna get it open by the August Bank Holiday,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}八月底 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:22.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-end of August. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:25.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吗 如果工期是六个礼拜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:25.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}All right? So if we keep six weeks in our head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.60,0:01:26.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有一些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.60,0:01:26.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And there are certain things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:28.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不会大规模翻修 好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:28.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're not gonna do much... No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但有些地方必须翻修
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:29.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But there are certain things we've gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:31.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}比如我们现在站的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:31.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}For example, what we're standing on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.16,0:01:33.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}翻修木平台 我希望它漂漂亮亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.16,0:01:33.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Repair the decking. I want it to look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:34.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}会的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:34.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it'll look brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:37.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是吗 这一块很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:37.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. So we've got a nice area out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:38.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:38.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来要解决的是供水问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:41.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The next job was water.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.40,0:01:44.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为勘查结果表明 喝了这里的水
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.40,0:01:44.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because the survey had revealed that if you drank it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你很快就会呕吐至死
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:47.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}you'd very quickly vomit yourself to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}井眼就在这里 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:50.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is where the borehole is. Yeah, there's a borehole down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:53.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们被告知 这个水有毒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:53.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And this is water, we've been told, is poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.72,0:01:55.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}水里有病菌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.72,0:01:55.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it's not... Well, it's got some disease in, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:01:56.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 不能喝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:01:56.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. It's not drinkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.08,0:01:59.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开张之前 必须把这个问题解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.08,0:01:59.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We have to get the water sorted before we can open the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:00.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 这个水不能用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:00.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, you can't use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:03.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}阿兰建议
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:03.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Alan suggested that instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们应当 接入马路对面为农场供水的供水主管道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:07.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we should tap into the main's pipe that fed the farm across the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:10.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}主管道就在那块地里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:10.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's where the water main is, in that field.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:12.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是吗 在这里 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:12.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, is it? In here? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:13.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}应该不难找
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:13.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, well, that's not gonna be difficult to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很容易 两分钟就能搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:15.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No. Easy. Two-minute job.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这里是残疾人厕所 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:18.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Disabled loos here. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.64,0:02:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就在丙烷罐的前方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.64,0:02:20.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In front of the propane tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.36,0:02:24.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}讨论完室内装修
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.36,0:02:24.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}After going through the interior jobs...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:27.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}隔墙 小吧台
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:27.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Stud wall. Little bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}换掉那个吧台 对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:30.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Change that bar. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:33.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们谈到了最关键的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:33.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We then got down to brass tacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你要问"多少钱"了吧 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no, you're gonna say "how much" now, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不担心这个 小菜一碟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:38.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I'm not worried about this. This is peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"小菜一碟"是多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:39.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What do you call "peanuts"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:41.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这么说吧 新搭一个木平台
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:41.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, let's just say, let's just say...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:45.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把它弄得更牢靠 一万到一万五
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:45.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}10,000 to 15,000 to put a brand-new decking down here and tighten it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:46.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:46.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}下一项是什么 供水
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:47.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Next? Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:50.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}供水主管道 这个需要几天时间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:50.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The water main, we're gonna piss about that for a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.64,0:02:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把水接过来大概要一千英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.64,0:02:53.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's just say £1,000 to get your water up here properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:55.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不算太贵 不贵吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:55.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Oh, that's not so bad. Not a big deal, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:02:58.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}下一项是什么 隔墙 以及楼上的吧台
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:02:58.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Next? Stud wall. And bar upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}吧台和隔墙 我看大约要五千英镑 还有管道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:02.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The bar and that stud wall, I think it's about five grand up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.56,0:03:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个简单
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.56,0:03:03.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.56,0:03:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}下一项是什么 楼下的吧台
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.56,0:03:05.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Next? Bar downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:06.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那就有所不同了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:06.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a bit different.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:08.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 在楼下弄个漂亮的吧台
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:08.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. What? Make a nice bar down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.64,0:03:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你得给我一个预算才行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.64,0:03:09.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}you wanna give me a budget on that really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:11.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 我可以做一个预算
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:11.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-If you wanted to spend six, seven... Yeah, no, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:12.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:12.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I can work that one out. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.12,0:03:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以总共是大约两万到两万五
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.12,0:03:16.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So really, it's sort of twenty to twenty-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 两万五 就能让这个酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:19.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, 25,000. We can make this pub...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:20.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}达到开业条件 对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:20.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Workable, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}阿兰的工人开始拆除朽烂的木平台
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:31.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Whilst Alan's lads set about demolishing the rotten decking,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我和他则去考察 是否有别的地方需要翻修
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:36.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He and I went to see if any other jobs needed doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}刚出发 我们就遇到了 一张令人愉快的面孔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:40.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And instantly, we ran into a welcome face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}杰哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:42.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}G-Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.48,0:03:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}杰里米
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.48,0:03:43.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Jeremy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.04,0:03:44.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}阿兰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.04,0:03:44.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:46.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老将军又回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:46.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The old general's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:48.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你的头发是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:48.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What have you done to your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:52.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 你是只有五英镑理发吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:52.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you only have five quid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:55.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不是 花了我十英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:55.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I got it done for ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:57.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我有钱 但是后面没剪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:57.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I have it, I have it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:03:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 弄了一下头顶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:03:59.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But they didn't do the back. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后又这样弄了一下 懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:02.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, over the top with the whole thing and then the whole thing on...
