Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.12,0:11:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不好意思 你刚刚买下来了 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.12,0:11:16.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm sorry, did you just buy them? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:17.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:20.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}1620 你用1620英镑买了两头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:20.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}1,620. So you've got two at 1,620.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.80,0:11:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}234号 1620
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.80,0:11:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}234, 1,620.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:23.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你是怎么出价的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:23.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How were you bidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.84,0:11:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就让你的脚趾甲 长长一点 他就看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.84,0:11:25.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Were you just letting your toenails grow and he saw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:27.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说 我没看见 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:27.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, I didn't see... Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这头牛不错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:30.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a nice beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:34.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个时候 我认为 是时候摆出老板的架子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:34.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}At this point, I decided it was time to pull rank...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}应该是我出价才对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:36.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm supposed to be bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:39.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}亲自买上几头牛了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:39.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And do some buying myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.32,0:11:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}1110 1120 1130 所以你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.32,0:11:43.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}1,120. 1,130. 1,130 for the bid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那就交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm leaving you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.80,0:11:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}1150
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.80,0:11:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}£1,150.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.32,0:11:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}1150
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.32,0:11:48.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}1,150. 1,150 for the bid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:51.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}别把手举着 成交 1150
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:51.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Stop putting your hand up! 1,150.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:53.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}将近两倍
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:53.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Nearly twice, nearly twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:56.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}被我买下来了 你以两倍价格买下来了 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:56.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Did I buy that? You bought it twice, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:11:58.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我买下来了 你自己跟自己抬价
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:11:58.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You bid yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:11:59.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:11:59.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.72,0:12:03.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}1170
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.72,0:12:03.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Seventy bid, seventy bid, seventy bid fifty...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管如此 我还是坚持自己出价
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:06.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Nevertheless, I continued on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:08.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一次 两次 成交 迪丽斯库阿特
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:08.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}1,270, Diddly Squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我很满意 这头牛很帅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:11.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm pleased with that. He's a good-looking cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.28,0:12:13.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}10 9 10 20
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.28,0:12:13.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}10, 9, 10, 20 bid. 50 bid, 40 bid, and £940.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.92,0:12:15.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}60
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.92,0:12:15.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And 60...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.80,0:12:16.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那几头被我买下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.80,0:12:16.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Did I buy those?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:17.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:17.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}20 80 90
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:20.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}20 bid, 80 bid, and 90 bid,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}100
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:22.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and 90 bid, and 90, and 100 bid, and 100 bid...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.16,0:12:24.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}直到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.16,0:12:24.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Until eventually...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:27.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}成交 迪丽斯库阿特 1260
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:27.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}60, Diddly Squat, 1,260.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你买了 一 二 三 四 五 六
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:32.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, you've got one, two, three, four, five, six...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你买了八头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:33.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以任务完成了 完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:35.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So we're done. We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.44,0:12:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等到交完钱 我的牛上了车
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.44,0:12:39.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}With the money handed over and my cows being loaded,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:43.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我向哈莉特请教了最后一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:43.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I asked Harriet to explain one last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:46.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}刚才我买下其中一头牛时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:46.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}When I bought one of those cows,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.48,0:12:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一个男的走过来 给了我四十英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.48,0:12:50.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-a man came over and gave me forty quid. Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:52.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他为什么要这样做 这是彩头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:52.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Why did he do that? It's "luck money".
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.28,0:12:54.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你买下别人的牛时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.28,0:12:54.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So when you buy someone's cows,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:12:57.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个人会赠送你彩头 作为你买牛的奖励
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:12:57.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}they give you "luck money" as an incentive to buy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.64,0:12:59.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以是现金 他给我现金
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.64,0:12:59.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's cash money he's just given me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.60,0:13:01.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 不用交税 我喜欢他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.60,0:13:01.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah. No tax. I like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.20,0:13:04.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在要交了 因为上电视了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.20,0:13:04.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, there is now, 'cause I've just put it on television.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:07.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}税务海关总署在看着呢 我们会把钱还给他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:07.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-HMRC are watching. We'll give it him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}告别了迪丽斯库阿特的兼职员工
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:11.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Having said goodbye to our part-time Diddly Squatter...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:13.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}多保重 好的 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:13.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Take care of yourself. Yeah. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我带着新买的牛回到了农场
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:19.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I headed back to the farm with my new cows...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:20.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 新来的母牛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:20.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, new cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.92,0:13:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}同时等着查理 热烈表扬我圆满完成任务
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.92,0:13:26.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}...and waited for Charlie to shower me with praise for a job well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:28.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:28.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Check 'em out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:31.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那两头利穆赞牛不错 非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:31.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Those two limousines are cracking. They're really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.88,0:13:34.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很快就能备宰了 那是哈莉特买的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.88,0:13:34.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They'll finish quite quickly. They're the ones Harriet bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.44,0:13:37.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}剩下的都是你挑的吧 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.44,0:13:37.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Who chose the other ones? Harriet? I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:39.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你不觉得这头很不错吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:39.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't you think this one's pretty cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不觉得 它的屁股不够丰满 没有肉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:42.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it hasn't got a round rump on the back. It's bare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:44.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那头怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:45.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What about that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.44,0:13:47.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}同样的问题 那头有什么问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.44,0:13:47.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Again. What's the matter with that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:48.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还不够大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:48.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They're not big enough yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:51.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它们的骨架不错 但是需要增肥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:51.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They've got good frames, but they need to pack some weight on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:53.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}市场上有肥牛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:54.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There were some fat cattle at the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:57.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是你说别买肥的 我是让你买肥的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:57.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah, but you said don't get fat ones. I said buy fat ones to you on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.88,0:14:01.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你让我买育肥牛 没让我买肥牛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.88,0:14:01.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You said: "Get store-store cattle, late store, not fat."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我说的是 第一批牛 需要在一个月后备宰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:04.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I said the first couple need to be a month from being finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以如果是肥牛 就已经被宰了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:07.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So if they'd have been fat, they'd have been finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我是不是搞错了 也不是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:09.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, God, have I done it wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:12.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}反正我们没搞对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:12.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, we've not done it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:16.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果运气好 那两头棕色的 也许八月底就能备宰了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:16.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So we might be lucky to finish those brown ones by the end of August.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:20.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这头大概要六个月
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:20.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This one, probably six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:22.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不会吧 六个月
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:22.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No? Six months?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.44,0:14:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}查理说 要想在更短时间内 让它们达到为酒吧供肉的体重
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.44,0:14:27.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie said the only way to get them ready for the pub more quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就必须让它们吃强化增肥饲料
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:31.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}was to put them on a high-intensity bulking-up diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.36,0:14:33.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个得换换
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.36,0:14:33.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You need to change this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.32,0:14:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好 我们会让你们变得又大又肥的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.32,0:14:37.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. We're going to make you big, fat cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}查理去张罗这件事了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:43.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}While Charlie went off to organise that,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.20,0:14:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我回到了风车餐厅
