Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.88,0:18:07.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I went to find Alan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我的天 老天爷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:10.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, man. God Almighty. Urgh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:12.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（德丁顿液体废物处理车）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:15.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他跟我发短信说 酒吧的化粪池装满了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:15.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}...who'd messaged me to say the pub's septic tank was full
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.60,0:18:18.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而且坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.60,0:18:18.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and also broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你们好 你好 杰里米
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:21.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, chaps? All right, Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.20,0:18:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.20,0:18:22.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是什么鬼东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:24.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What is all this shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是纤维玻璃罐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:26.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's the fibreglass tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.24,0:18:28.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是罐内塌掉的隔板
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.24,0:18:28.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's the baffle that has collapsed inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:30.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}过来 杰里米 看看下面那些洞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:30.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on over, Jeremy, and have a look down 'em holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.88,0:18:32.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看下面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.88,0:18:32.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You have a look down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.72,0:18:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我的天 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.72,0:18:36.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh my fucking... I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.80,0:18:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}难以置信 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.80,0:18:49.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Unbelievable. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:52.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我操 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:52.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Fuck me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.12,0:18:56.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我去 问题主要出在油脂身上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.12,0:18:56.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}A lot of the problem with this is grease.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:18:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你闻到的就是油脂的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:18:58.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's what you can smell, grease.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:00.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那股刺鼻的气味 对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:00.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that what that is, that sharpness?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.96,0:19:03.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}油脂 我闻着像是屎味
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.96,0:19:03.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Grease? That smells like shit to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:05.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很可能就是油脂的重量压塌了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:05.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's probably what's collapsed the baffle inside, the weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:07.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}里面的隔板 隔板是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:07.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What's a baffle? The weight of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:09.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}将粪便和水隔开的板子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:09.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It separates the shit from the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:11.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他在把油脂抽出来吗 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:11.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is he pumping it out now? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}抽到你们的罐车里 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:13.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And that's going in your wagon up there? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:17.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得在里面铺设新的管道 让它恢复正常使用
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:17.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna put some new pipes in it to make it work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:18.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:18.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:22.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}别忘了 这是上世纪 60或70年代修建的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:22.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You gotta bear in mind this was the sixties or seventies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}建成之后从未清理过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:23.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Never been cleaned out a touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:25.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也就是说 油脂和粪便已经堆积了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:25.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's been collecting grease and shit for...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}自从80年代酒吧开张以来 但罐子的年代更久远
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:28.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Since the pub opened in the eighties. But the tank was here beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}五十多年了 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:30.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Fifty-odd years. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.16,0:19:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看 有人把这个掉进去了 有人把这个掉进厕所了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.16,0:19:34.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look. Somebody's dropped it down the bog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.84,0:19:37.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}说不定还能用 他说"说不定还能用"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.84,0:19:37.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It might still work. "It might still work," he said!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.48,0:19:40.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有新手机了 我的老天爷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.48,0:19:40.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got a new telephone! Oh my fucking God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我不信
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:44.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no, I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:46.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他在那里面 那个人在那里面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:48.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He's in there. That man is in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:49.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他怎么呼吸 他明天要去度假
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:51.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How does he breathe? He's going on holiday tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:56.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}明天他要去希腊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:56.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He's going to Greece tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.24,0:19:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但麻烦的是 他明天要去希腊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.24,0:19:58.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-But the trouble is- He's going to Greece tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.36,0:20:01.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 他身上的油脂臭味会持续一个礼拜 会被人嘲笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.36,0:20:01.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, and he'll stink of grease for a week now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他本来可以干任何一行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:03.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So he could have done any job in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:05.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 但他偏偏选了这一行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:05.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. But he went, "No."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们跟大粪打了一辈子交道了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:07.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But we've been in the shit all our life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗨 你好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:10.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.36,0:20:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我的处境比你好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.36,0:20:11.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I'm better than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.72,0:20:12.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}要不要进来看看 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.72,0:20:12.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Coming in? Yeah, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:14.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}幸亏我太胖了 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:14.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm too fat, mercifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.76,0:20:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.76,0:20:15.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.52,0:20:19.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}伙计们 你们太棒了 非常了不起的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.52,0:20:19.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Guys, you're amazing. Amazing, amazing work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.96,0:20:24.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很好 老大
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.96,0:20:24.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.48,0:20:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来的几天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.48,0:20:25.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Over the following days,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}酒吧的工地上 都是一派热火朝天的景象
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:29.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}work on the pub continued at an industrious pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但现在这里又脏又破 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:38.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But it is a shitty shithole at the moment, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在各种各样的工人当中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:46.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And in amongst all the manual labour,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}苏在试着找一个主厨 好的 如果工人还在的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:50.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sue tried to find a chef... Cooking...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:52.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而丽莎去买家具了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:52.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And Lisa went shopping for furniture.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我超级喜欢法国小酒馆的桌子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:55.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm a big fan of the French bistrot table.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.60,0:20:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个基座不错 可以在上面放一块大理石
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.60,0:20:59.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is a nice base as well. We could get a piece of marble on there, couldn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:03.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 你太宠我了 看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:03.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Gosh, what are you doing to me? Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.72,0:21:08.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}与此同时 我得为 新买的母牛准备增肥饲料
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.72,0:21:08.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I, meanwhile, had to prepare the bulking-up diet for the new cows,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:15.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着 我得先去一趟豪客斯通啤酒厂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:15.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}which first of all meant a trip over to the Hawkstone brewery.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.24,0:21:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这些有多重
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.24,0:21:17.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And how much do these weigh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.88,0:21:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}将近一吨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.88,0:21:19.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Nearly a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.80,0:21:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}酿酒师马克 已将一些适用的原料装箱了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.80,0:21:24.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}...where Mark the brewer had boxed up some suitable ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这些箱子中装的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:28.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So what we've got in each of these
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}叫做酒糟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:30.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}is what's called brewer's grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.96,0:21:32.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是酿酒过程中产生的废料
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.96,0:21:32.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And that's a waste product from the brewery.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:36.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这箱有半吨 那箱也是半吨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:36.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Half a ton in this one, half a ton in that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.44,0:21:40.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后把酒糟拿去喂母牛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.44,0:21:40.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then you take that over and feed it to the cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这就形成了一种循环
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:41.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And there's a circularity then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:44.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}拿废料喂母牛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:44.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So waste product feeds cows,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}母牛长胖 母牛在地里大便
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:47.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}cows get fat, cows shit on field,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:50.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}地里种植大麦 再将大麦运回这里酿成啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:50.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}grow barley in field, bring it back here, make it into beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.80,0:21:53.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}太有可持续性了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.80,0:21:53.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's just so sustainable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.44,0:21:56.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我简直就是 穿着长筒雨靴的格蕾塔·通贝里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.44,0:21:56.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm basically Greta Thunberg but in wellies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.80,0:22:03.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}回到农场 我跟副主厨卡莱布会合
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.80,0:22:03.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Back at the farm, I met up with sous-chef Kaleb,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.32,0:22:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开始为母牛们制作大餐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.32,0:22:07.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}so we could start making the cows their mega meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.88,0:22:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}将这个跟去年由于品质不够好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.88,0:22:11.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So this mixed up with the barley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.28,0:22:13.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没卖出去的大麦混合 然后搅拌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.28,0:22:13.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that we couldn't sell last year 'cause it wasn't good enough for beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.20,0:22:16.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}搅拌 然后加入糖蜜 对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.20,0:22:16.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Literally roll that, though. Roll it. And then molasses. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.00,0:22:20.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为了增加甜味 为了让它们觉得好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.00,0:22:20.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}For that treacly taste. To make this stuff palatable for them. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.24,0:22:24.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后加入制作植物油时产生的废料
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.24,0:22:24.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then the waste product from making our vegetable oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.44,0:22:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.44,0:22:25.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.44,0:22:27.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}或者 你听听这个主意怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.44,0:22:27.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Or... How's this for an idea:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.84,0:22:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}何不每天为它们买威瑟斯本的早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.84,0:22:31.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}why don't we just buy them a Wetherspoons' breakfast every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.36,0:22:36.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为了把奶牛餐饮服务办起来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.36,0:22:36.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In order to get the cow catering underway,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.68,0:22:40.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}查理预订了一台超级大的 乡村版Magimix食品加工机
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.68,0:22:40.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie had ordered in a giant rural Magimix.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:42.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hiya. How're you doing, mate?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.20,0:22:43.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 我叫詹姆斯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.20,0:22:43.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, good. How are you? James.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.56,0:22:46.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗨 我叫杰里米 你好 我叫詹姆斯 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.56,0:22:46.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Hi, there. Jeremy. How are you? James. How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.40,0:22:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它就像一台巨型吸尘器
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.40,0:22:48.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's like a big hoover.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.40,0:22:50.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把大麦吸进去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.40,0:22:50.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Suck your barley in,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.92,0:22:53.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把油菜籽吸进去 嗯 搅拌均匀 全都进到中央
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.92,0:22:53.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}suck your rape meal in, mixes it all up, then it all goes in the centre.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.84,0:22:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在那里面搅拌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.84,0:22:54.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, it mixes it in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.08,0:22:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.08,0:22:55.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.08,0:22:58.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我还准备了矿物质和糖蜜 一起加进去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.08,0:22:58.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then I've got minerals and molasses to go in as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.72,0:23:07.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看着好有满足感
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.72,0:23:07.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That is so satisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.16,0:23:09.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我可以玩上一天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.16,0:23:09.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I could do this all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.68,0:23:16.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}要不要拿开一点 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.68,0:23:16.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Shall I break it up a bit? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我好喜欢用罐车做饭这个点子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:21.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I love the idea of cooking with a lorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.36,0:23:25.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}戈登·拉姆齐 马可·皮尔·怀特
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.36,0:23:25.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Gordon Ramsay, Marco Pierre White,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.80,0:23:28.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}安格斯牛排馆 他们不会用罐车做饭
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.80,0:23:28.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Angus Steakhouse, they don't cook with lorries.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.84,0:23:34.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.84,0:23:34.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.76,0:23:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}牛饲料
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.76,0:23:36.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Cow food.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.28,0:23:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}到了下午晚些时候的喂牛时间 我们加入酒糟
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.28,0:23:43.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}At feeding time, later that afternoon, we added in the brewer's grain...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.12,0:23:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}像这样撒在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.12,0:23:46.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You just sprinkle that over the top like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.88,0:23:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}晚餐上桌了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.88,0:23:48.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And dinner was served.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.44,0:23:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你们好 奶牛们 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.44,0:23:54.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Moo cows! This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:58.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}香喷喷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:58.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Mmm! Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.04,0:23:59.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.04,0:23:59.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.60,0:24:02.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 看啊 吃光它
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.60,0:24:02.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, look at that. Eat it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.64,0:24:04.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.64,0:24:04.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.32,0:24:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}加了糖蜜之后 多好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.32,0:24:06.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How delicious is that with the molasses in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.80,0:24:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我已经看到它们越长越肥了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.80,0:24:09.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I can see them getting fatter and fatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.76,0:24:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它们很爱吃 你看 它们确实非常爱吃
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.76,0:24:12.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They love it, look. They really do love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.28,0:24:24.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}酒吧那边 几乎所有 能走的地方都无处落脚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.28,0:24:24.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Over at the pub, nearly every surface you could walk on was out of bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.56,0:24:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}于是我出去清理灌木丛了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.56,0:24:30.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So I headed outside to clear the undergrowth
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.20,0:24:32.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}和我最喜爱的同伴一起
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.20,0:24:32.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}with my favourite companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.64,0:24:36.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好样的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.64,0:24:36.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.44,0:24:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 情绪抚慰组又回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.44,0:24:41.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes! The emotional support unit is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.72,0:24:44.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而且它饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.72,0:24:44.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And he's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.24,0:24:51.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}只可惜我的心理治疗 被苏和瑞秋打断了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.24,0:24:51.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sadly though, my therapy session was cut short by Sue and Rachel
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:55.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}她们说有急事要找我谈
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:55.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}who called me in for an urgent chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.16,0:24:58.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}任务清单的第一项
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.16,0:24:58.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, first on our list,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.64,0:25:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}用遮阳伞把木平台遮住
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.64,0:25:01.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}covering the deck with some jumbrellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.12,0:25:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大约40分钟之前就该下订单了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.12,0:25:05.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We needed to sign it off about forty minutes ago
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.52,0:25:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这样才能保证遮阳伞及时
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.52,0:25:08.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to guarantee the jumbrellas arriving in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.24,0:25:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}送达 要多少钱 是那种巨型遮阳伞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.24,0:25:10.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How much are the jumbrellas? These are the big umbrellas, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.68,0:25:13.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 用三把超大的遮阳伞 遮住整个木平台
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.68,0:25:13.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, three enormous umbrellas to cover the entire deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:14.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:14.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.88,0:25:16.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大约要四万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.88,0:25:16.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Approximately £40,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.88,0:25:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}包括电动配件 照明
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.88,0:25:19.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Including electrics, lighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.28,0:25:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果未来用上三相电 也不会过时
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.28,0:25:23.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}future proofing, ready for three-phase if we ever get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.20,0:25:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们跟阿兰谈过了 但是没谈安装的事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.20,0:25:26.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We have spoken to Alan about it, but not installation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.20,0:25:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不好意思 你们把我说糊涂了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.20,0:25:28.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sorry. You're saying words.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.12,0:25:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}三把遮阳伞要四万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.12,0:25:31.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Forty thousand for three umbrellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.44,0:25:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 伞很大 直径八米 三把遮阳伞要四万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.44,0:25:35.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah. They're massive. Eight metres. £40,000 for three umbrellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.44,0:25:36.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.44,0:25:36.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.44,0:25:40.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果不把木平台遮住 遇到下雨天没人能在那里用餐
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.44,0:25:40.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you didn't cover the terrace and it was raining, no one can eat there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.44,0:25:42.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我很清楚我们需要遮阳伞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.44,0:25:42.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I'm well aware that we need umbrellas, I know that,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.36,0:25:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我发自内心地认为 这个价格太离谱了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.36,0:25:46.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but I really genuinely believe that's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.68,0:25:49.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们是想避免
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.68,0:25:49.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What we were trying to avoid was having....
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.20,0:25:51.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}其实可以用 便宜得多的方法遮住木平台
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.20,0:25:51.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because we could cover that deck a lot more cheaply
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.96,0:25:53.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}改用小遮阳伞就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.96,0:25:53.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}with more of a parasol-type situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.84,0:25:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 但是酒吧位于山顶上 考虑到木平台的面积
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.84,0:25:57.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. But given the size of the deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.44,0:26:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要大概五十把小遮阳伞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.44,0:26:00.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we would need probably fifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.20,0:26:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这会让木平台变成一片伞的海洋
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.20,0:26:02.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So it would sort of just look like a sea of umbrellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.60,0:26:05.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而且桌子可能是那种形状
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.60,0:26:05.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Plus the table's probably that shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.84,0:26:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}伞是圆的 放在中间 如果有点阳光 问题不大
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.84,0:26:07.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The brolly's round in the middle. A lovely bit of sun, no probs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.12,0:26:09.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}苏会被淋成落汤鸡 我就没事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.12,0:26:09.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So Sue's getting soaking wet. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.00,0:26:12.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}瑞秋在里面 你会被淋湿 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.00,0:26:12.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Rachel's in. You're wet. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.68,0:26:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就是这样 我的人生怎么会搞成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.68,0:26:14.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}End of. How have I reached this point in life?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.76,0:26:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你这样说 是不是表示 同意买巨型遮阳伞了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.76,0:26:17.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Have you come round to the brollies now you've said it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.28,0:26:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不是 我只是无法相信 我活了64岁了 竟然会有人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.28,0:26:21.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I just cannot believe I'm 64 and somebody's just said to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.80,0:26:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一本正经地对我说
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.80,0:26:22.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}in all seriousness:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.88,0:26:25.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"对了 那些伞要四万英镑"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.88,0:26:25.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Oh, by the way, the umbrellas are forty thousand."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.80,0:26:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这么多钱都够买一辆高尔夫GTI了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.80,0:26:28.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You can buy a fucking Golf GTI for that. Did you sort of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.28,0:26:31.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你原本希望买酒吧的钱 占开支的大头吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.28,0:26:31.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that the purchase of the pub might be the big one?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.44,0:26:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我原本想的是 弄个新吧台就可以开张了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.44,0:26:33.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I just thought I'd put a new bar in and open it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.08,0:26:37.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这恰恰是你不需要的 现在这个吧台就挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.08,0:26:37.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's probably the one thing you don't really need. That bar's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.92,0:26:38.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}额
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.92,0:26:38.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.96,0:26:40.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们还没告诉你买家具要多少钱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.96,0:26:40.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We haven't told you how much the furniture is yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.56,0:26:43.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 丽莎看了一些很漂亮的家具
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.56,0:26:43.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah. Lisa saw some lovely stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.32,0:26:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}非常不错的选择 多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.32,0:26:46.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Really good choices. Yeah, and how much?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.20,0:26:47.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}四万英镑 对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.20,0:26:47.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Forty thousand. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.40,0:26:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 遮阳伞的事怎么定
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.40,0:26:52.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, where are we on the umbrellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.80,0:26:57.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你们得给我一个小时考虑一下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.80,0:26:57.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You're gonna have to give me an hour to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.32,0:26:58.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.32,0:26:58.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.36,0:27:03.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}预算严重超支
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.36,0:27:03.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}With the budget being blown to smithereens,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.36,0:27:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我出去跟阿兰聊了聊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.36,0:27:06.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I went outside to have a catch-up with Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.80,0:27:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这东西太棒了 很棒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.80,0:27:10.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is amazing this stuff, isn't it? It's brilliant, innit?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.52,0:27:12.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以走两步试试 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.52,0:27:12.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And you try it, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.64,0:27:16.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}绝对不会有人摔倒 是吧 是的 除非你喝得烂醉
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.64,0:27:16.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You really can't fall over, can you? No. Well, unless you're pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.96,0:27:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你想听好消息还是坏消息 好消息是这里景色很好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.96,0:27:21.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, do you want the good news or the bad? I know it's a beautiful view.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.20,0:27:23.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么坏消息
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.20,0:27:23.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.24,0:27:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}成本翻了一倍
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.24,0:27:25.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's fucking gone up double, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.12,0:27:29.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么成本 这个 翻了一倍多 因为那个
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.12,0:27:29.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-What has? This. Over double. 'Cause of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.48,0:27:32.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么 是的 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.48,0:27:32.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What? Yeah. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.60,0:27:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你在开玩笑吧 不 我没开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.60,0:27:35.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You're kidding. No! No, I'm not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.96,0:27:39.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}之前说的是两万英镑 现在要四万多
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.96,0:27:39.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's gonna be over forty thousand now, from the twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.04,0:27:42.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们也没办法 他们说要用防滑板
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.04,0:27:42.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But look, we've got no option. They said anti-slip decking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.04,0:27:45.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们只能用这种板子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.04,0:27:45.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We cannot do it without this kind of stuff, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.88,0:27:47.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这就要增加两万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.88,0:27:47.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And that adds £20,000? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.04,0:27:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 板子的成本增加了一万六
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.04,0:27:48.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it's- What? That?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.00,0:27:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}外加额外的人工成本
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.00,0:27:50.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's gonna add about sixteen,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.32,0:27:52.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}外加其他额外成本
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.32,0:27:52.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}plus the labour's extra, plus everything's extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.68,0:27:55.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}锯片切不动它 我得不断买锯片
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.68,0:27:55.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The blades, you can't cut it, I had to keep buying blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.64,0:27:56.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.64,0:27:56.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.00,0:27:58.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}关于遮阳伞的争论有结果了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.00,0:27:58.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That settles this umbrella debate. You know these forty--
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.04,0:28:00.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 我们不要遮阳伞 一把都不要
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.04,0:28:00.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, we're not having 'em. None of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.36,0:28:01.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.36,0:28:01.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, but hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.52,0:28:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道那种从建筑上 伸出来的那种遮阳帆吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.52,0:28:05.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You know those sails that you get coming off buildings?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.36,0:28:09.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果把遮阳帆从 我还是指给你看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.36,0:28:09.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you ran them from between... Oh, I'll show you actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.00,0:28:11.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果把遮阳帆
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.00,0:28:11.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you ran the sails...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.64,0:28:18.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果把遮阳帆固定在 门框顶部与排水管之间 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.64,0:28:18.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you mounted them between the top of the door and the drainpipe... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.60,0:28:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后让它斜着向下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.60,0:28:20.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you put a slope on them...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.40,0:28:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我会让它斜着向上 这里立一根杆子 先向上 再向下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.40,0:28:24.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I'd go up. And I'd put a pole here. You can go up, then go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.80,0:28:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.80,0:28:25.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.08,0:28:28.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}村里的"三个马蹄铁"酒吧用的是帐篷
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.08,0:28:28.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}they've just put a sort of tented arrangement up at the Three Horseshoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.76,0:28:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.76,0:28:29.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Have they?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.92,0:28:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们把遮阳帆弄来 看看效果如何
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.92,0:28:31.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We gotta get 'em here and have a look, haven't we? See what they can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.56,0:28:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.56,0:28:33.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.00,0:28:38.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}显然 花个两万五千英镑 就能让酒吧开张的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.00,0:28:38.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Clearly, the notion of opening the pub for £25,000
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.00,0:28:42.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}与实际情况差了十万八千里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.00,0:28:42.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}had been massively wide of the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.48,0:28:44.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（风车 场地出租与餐厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.20,0:28:45.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我现在没时间想这个
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.20,0:28:45.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But there was no time to dwell on that,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.60,0:28:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为像个人肉乒乓球一般 来回奔波的我
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.60,0:28:49.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because in my new role as human ping-pong ball,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.64,0:28:51.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}要赶回农场
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.64,0:28:51.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I had to bounce back to the farm
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.16,0:28:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那里又有一窝猪崽刚刚出生了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.16,0:28:55.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}where we'd just had a new crop of piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.84,0:28:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.84,0:28:59.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.76,0:29:01.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它一只都没压死吧 一支猪崽大军
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.76,0:29:01.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Has she kept them all? An army of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.80,0:29:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一 二
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.80,0:29:03.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}One, two,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.84,0:29:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}三 四 五 六 七 八 九 你数不清的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.84,0:29:06.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-three, four, five. You wouldn't be able to count them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.16,0:29:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那下面还有一只 十只
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.16,0:29:08.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Six, seven, eight, nine and then one under there, ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.52,0:29:11.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没有伤亡
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.52,0:29:11.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No casualties. Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.48,0:29:14.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看它们爬来爬去的样子 老天 太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.48,0:29:14.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at the way they just climb all over! Oh, my God, they're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.88,0:29:15.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它是个好妈妈 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.88,0:29:15.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}She's a great mum, though, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.00,0:29:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我简直不敢相信 这是个天大的好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.00,0:29:18.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't believe it. This is tremendous news.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.64,0:29:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们去看理查德·汉姆
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.64,0:29:22.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Then we went over to see Richard Ham
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.64,0:29:26.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为兽医迪尔翁 想到了一个照顾它的新计划
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.64,0:29:26.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because Dilwyn the vet had come up with a new plan for looking after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.44,0:29:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在的情况是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.44,0:29:30.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So here's the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.28,0:29:33.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}理查德·汉姆已经到了 快对它的姐妹们下手的年龄了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.28,0:29:33.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Richard Ham's now old enough to start having a go on his sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.88,0:29:34.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以必须把它跟公猪关在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.88,0:29:34.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}so we have to put him back in the boy pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.00,0:29:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.00,0:29:35.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.96,0:29:39.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是迪尔翁说 如果直接把它和公猪关在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.96,0:29:39.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But Dilwyn says if we put him straight in the boy pen,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.76,0:29:41.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它们会欺负它 甚至有可能弄死它
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.76,0:29:41.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}they'll beat him up. They might even kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.36,0:29:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.36,0:29:42.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.36,0:29:44.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他说唯一的办法是搭一个小猪圈
