Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.60,0:33:20.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它们在这里 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.60,0:33:20.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is where they are. There you go, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.36,0:33:25.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}埃隆的死亡射线让它们 始终待在我们希望它们待的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.36,0:33:25.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That Elon's death ray is keeping them where we want them to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.20,0:33:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好 来吧 山羊们
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.20,0:33:28.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, come on, goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.28,0:33:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好了吗 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.28,0:33:29.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you ready? I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.92,0:33:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在它们完全听话了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.92,0:33:33.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Now they were fully compliant, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.28,0:33:35.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我可以放它们出来 让它们做当初买它们时
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.28,0:33:35.62,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I could release them to do the job I'd bought them
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.62,0:33:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}想让它们做的工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.62,0:33:36.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}for in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.12,0:33:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 山羊们 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.12,0:33:38.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.44,0:33:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 山羊们
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.44,0:33:40.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.72,0:33:45.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}工作就是清除农场中 不易到达处的荆棘丛
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.72,0:33:45.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Which was to clear the brambles in all the inaccessible parts of the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.64,0:33:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}原来山羊真的很擅长爬坡
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.64,0:33:48.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It turns out goats are really good on a hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.84,0:33:50.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}要的就是这个效果
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.84,0:33:50.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's kind of the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.32,0:33:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.32,0:33:53.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.60,0:33:56.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的"清除行动"启动了 在我们永远都无法围起来的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.60,0:33:56.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Now we're on Operation Clear, where we would never ever be able to fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.40,0:33:58.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看那边
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.40,0:33:58.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at that in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.60,0:34:01.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它们在狼吞虎咽 简直就是山羊的天堂
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.60,0:34:01.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They're ravenous, aren't they? That is just goat paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.80,0:34:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它们在这里清理了多大面积了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.80,0:34:05.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How much of the area have they got here then?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.64,0:34:06.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 看看应用就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.64,0:34:06.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well... Look at the app.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.96,0:34:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我没有那个应用 我有
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.96,0:34:09.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't have the app. I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.24,0:34:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个应用很棒 对吧 快六亩了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.24,0:34:12.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a bit less than an acre.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.24,0:34:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不对 是一公顷 够了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.24,0:34:14.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}A hectare rather.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.48,0:34:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 因为我们只想让它们 啃食特定区域的荆棘丛
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.48,0:34:18.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, yeah, no, 'cause you want them to just graze certain areas down
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.20,0:34:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后把它们转移到别处
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.20,0:34:19.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and then move them through.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.40,0:34:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就像围牧一样
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.40,0:34:20.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's like mob grazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.68,0:34:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是当初买它们的目的 让它们搞定这些荆棘丛
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.68,0:34:26.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But this is what we got them for, is to nail these brambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.72,0:34:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这才多久 不到五分钟吧 你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.72,0:34:28.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And within, what, five minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.08,0:34:31.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那片荆棘丛就快被消灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.08,0:34:31.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that bramble bush is really in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.52,0:34:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.52,0:34:33.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.12,0:34:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}除了让新买的牛长胖
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.12,0:34:42.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Apart from making the new cows fatter,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.96,0:34:46.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}动物管理方面 就没有什么急需解决的问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.96,0:34:46.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}there were no more immediate animal-management demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.88,0:34:52.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}于是我将注意力 转回到了风车餐厅上来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.88,0:34:52.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I turned my attention back to The Windmill,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.36,0:34:54.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我突然有了一个奇思妙想
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.36,0:34:54.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}where I'd had a brainwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.92,0:34:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}离正方形大概只差十到十五厘米
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.92,0:34:58.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's only about ten to fifteen mil out of square.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.48,0:35:02.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为了突出酒吧与农场的关联
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.48,0:35:02.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In order to highlight my pub's connection to farming,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.00,0:35:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我打算在天花板上挂一台旧拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.00,0:35:05.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I would hang an old tractor from the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.96,0:35:10.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 我想先把拖拉机改造一番
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.96,0:35:10.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}First, though, I wanted to get it modified.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.04,0:35:14.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好 拖拉机已经有了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.04,0:35:14.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, I've got the tractor
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.88,0:35:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在需要将它镀铬并减轻重量
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.88,0:35:17.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and now I need to get it chromed and lightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.76,0:35:20.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直认为 遇到这种工作
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.76,0:35:20.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And I always think when you've got a job like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.16,0:35:23.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}最好是把它交给村里的小矮人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.16,0:35:23.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}you're better off giving it to a little man in a village.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.72,0:35:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我来到了一个 远离文明几百公里的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.72,0:35:29.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So I've come to a village hundreds and hundreds of miles from civilisation
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.72,0:35:33.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}村里有个超矮的小矮人 他将为我完成这项工作
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.72,0:35:33.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}where there's a very little man who's going to do the work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.60,0:35:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.60,0:35:36.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.68,0:35:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.68,0:35:38.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.92,0:35:43.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 欢迎 就是 就是这台
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.92,0:35:43.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello! Welcome. This is... This is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.00,0:35:44.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.00,0:35:44.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.04,0:35:46.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是1935年款 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.04,0:35:46.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a 35. I know it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.80,0:35:48.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}非常漂亮的拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.80,0:35:48.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a really nice tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.80,0:35:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}当然了 在你们这里 这就算是现代化了 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.80,0:35:51.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This, of course, where you live, is called "modern", isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.32,0:35:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这玩意真不错 别人看到了会说
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.32,0:35:54.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Out here, it's a fine thing! People going:
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.20,0:35:56.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"看啊 这是内燃机吗"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.20,0:35:56.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Look at this. Is that internal combustion?"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.80,0:35:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我见过比这台更破的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.80,0:35:58.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We have worse than this turn up. "Now look 'ere."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.52,0:36:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我见过更破的拖拉机送来修复的 我们这里不是威尔士
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.52,0:36:01.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We have worse than this turn up for restoration. We're not Welsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.04,0:36:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就是威尔士 不是威尔士
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.04,0:36:03.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It is Wales. It's not Wales.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.40,0:36:06.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大约四个小时之前 我穿过了M5高速路
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.40,0:36:06.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I crossed the M5 about four hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.00,0:36:08.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}M5不是边境线 就是
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.00,0:36:08.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-The M5 isn't the boundary. It is the bor--
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.96,0:36:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不是 就是 当你
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.96,0:36:10.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-It isn't. It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.44,0:36:12.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不是说威尔士人站在M5的这边
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.44,0:36:12.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not Welsh people on one side of the M5
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.56,0:36:13.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}英格兰人拿着弓箭站在另一边
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.56,0:36:13.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and English with bows and arrows on the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.76,0:36:14.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就是
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.76,0:36:14.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.12,0:36:19.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在我们搞清楚了 几百年的政治和地理知识后
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.12,0:36:19.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Once we'd sorted out several hundred years of politics and geography,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.08,0:36:22.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}话题又回到了我的拖拉机上
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.08,0:36:22.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we got back to my tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.52,0:36:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我需要把重量降到750公斤以下 不然会把屋顶拉塌
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.52,0:36:27.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So we've gotta get it down to under 750 kilograms or I'll pull the roof down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.96,0:36:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果把拖拉机内部掏空 把传动轴之类的全都拿掉
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.96,0:36:32.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If we take all the internals out, everything, prop shafts, everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.16,0:36:36.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后镀铬 给引擎盖和轮拱镀铬
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.16,0:36:36.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then chrome the bonnet and the wheel arches.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.08,0:36:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你想给哪些部位镀铬 红色的部位
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.08,0:36:39.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Which bits do you want to chrome? The red bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.56,0:36:42.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}哦 好 所以你不想给这些地方镀铬
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.56,0:36:42.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, right. So you don't wanna chrome all these bits?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.52,0:36:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不想
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.52,0:36:43.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.52,0:36:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得应该用汉默莱特的漆 好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.52,0:36:45.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah! I think that should be Hammerite.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.04,0:36:47.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}黑色 你知道的 那种
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.04,0:36:47.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Black? Well, you know, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.92,0:36:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 是叫汉默莱特吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.92,0:36:49.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it Hammerite?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.76,0:36:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}汉默莱特确实是一种漆 这是你的专业领域
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.76,0:36:51.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Hammerite is... It's your world, this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.72,0:36:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.72,0:36:52.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah, it is! Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.80,0:36:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}感觉好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.80,0:36:54.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is so weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.84,0:36:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在那是你的专业领域 而那是我的专业领域
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.84,0:36:57.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's your world now and that's my world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.08,0:37:00.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你得在童话闹剧季开始前完工
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.08,0:37:00.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, you've gotta get this done before panto season starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.48,0:37:02.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.48,0:37:02.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Does that mean the cust--
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.44,0:37:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你什么时候去斯温顿
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.44,0:37:05.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So when are you off to Swindon?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.36,0:37:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不去 你会去的 我不去 你会去的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.36,0:37:07.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-I'm not going to... I'm not. You are. You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.24,0:37:15.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}知道吗 你上我们的节目了 以什么方式
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.24,0:37:15.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You know you're in the show? In what way?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.28,0:37:16.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}隆重的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.28,0:37:16.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, in a big way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.92,0:37:19.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么可能 我还什么事都没做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.92,0:37:19.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, how can I be in it? I haven't done anything in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.40,0:37:21.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 你已经做了 只是你不知道而已
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.40,0:37:21.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, you have, but you just don't know you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.44,0:37:26.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你做出了巨大的贡献 好吧 跟你说实话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.44,0:37:26.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Your contribution is immense, I've gotta be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.76,0:37:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}非常亮眼 而且有点没有尊严
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.76,0:37:30.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Immense and in some ways... not dignified.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.80,0:37:31.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.80,0:37:31.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.36,0:37:33.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}卸下拖拉机后
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.36,0:37:33.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Once the tractor was off,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.88,0:37:37.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}话锋一转 聊到了我最不喜欢的话题
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.88,0:37:37.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the conversation turned to my least favourite topic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.32,0:37:40.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 你想谈谈价格和预算吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.32,0:37:40.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, do you wanna talk prices and budget?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.76,0:37:42.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大笔预算 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.76,0:37:42.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-We can do. It's filthy money.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.28,0:37:45.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那个酒吧的各项预算都严重超标了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.28,0:37:45.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}On that pub, everything costs too much money.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.72,0:37:47.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很好 我们也可以超标 对
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.72,0:37:47.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Good. Well, we can keep up with that. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.88,0:37:51.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说 你的预算是 几百 几千 几万还是几百万
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.88,0:37:51.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, are we talking hundreds, thousands, tens of thousands or millions?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.04,0:37:53.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}几万 几万
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.04,0:37:53.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Tens of thousands.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.16,0:37:55.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可能要两万左右
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.16,0:37:55.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Tens? Probably be up to about twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.40,0:37:58.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 两万 就镀个铬 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.40,0:37:58.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No? Twenty? What, to chrome it? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.08,0:38:01.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 去除不要的东西 把内部掏空
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.08,0:38:01.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, to strip it all down, take all the gubbins out from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.72,0:38:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这需要动用机器 我都能完成
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.72,0:38:03.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That'll have to be machined. I could have done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.96,0:38:06.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}给拖拉机喷个漆要两万
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.96,0:38:06.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}£20,000 to paint a tractor?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.92,0:38:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 重点在于 当你的荷包在大出血时
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.92,0:38:11.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, the point is, as your bank balance is taking a bit of a beating,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.20,0:38:12.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就要让它继续出血
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.20,0:38:12.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}let's keep it going.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.60,0:38:16.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么要放弃呢 那会给它时间积蓄力量
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.60,0:38:16.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Why give up? Then it'll have time to strengthen like that
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.40,0:38:19.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后它会反抗 然后更难从里面弄出钱来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.40,0:38:19.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and then it'll be resistant, and it'll be harder to get anything out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.32,0:38:21.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在的它疲弱无力
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.32,0:38:21.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Whereas now, it's floppy and weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.80,0:38:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}遍体鳞伤 别漫天要价 别漫天要价
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.80,0:38:24.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Be sensible. Be sensible. Wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.68,0:38:27.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不然我将坐在飞龙剧院的第一排
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.68,0:38:27.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Otherwise I will be on the front row at the Wyvern.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.60,0:38:28.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.60,0:38:28.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.68,0:38:31.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}观察你扮演巴顿斯的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.68,0:38:31.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And I will be making observations about your performance as Buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.32,0:38:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不演童话闹剧 油漆要多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.32,0:38:33.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not doing panto. How much is the paint?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.68,0:38:37.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一升至少要三千英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.68,0:38:37.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The paint's gonna be at least three grand a litre.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.92,0:38:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一升 一升铬漆
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.92,0:38:39.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}A litre? A litre for chrome paint, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.16,0:38:41.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么不在我出发前告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.16,0:38:41.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Why didn't you tell me before I set off
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.00,0:38:45.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}费用会比大部分 欧洲国家的GDP还要高
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.00,0:38:45.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that it was going to be more than the GDP of most European countries?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.92,0:38:47.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为说了你可能就不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.92,0:38:47.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because then you might not have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.16,0:38:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我肯定不会来 但是你拖拉机都买了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.16,0:38:49.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-I wouldn't have come. You have and you've brought the tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.24,0:38:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 是你自己找上门来的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.24,0:38:52.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So basically, you've lowered your plums into my vice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.00,0:38:56.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不过是报价高了一点点 现在
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.00,0:38:56.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And I've nipped it up a little bit. And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.44,0:38:59.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果来的是一个普通农民
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.44,0:38:59.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If this was a normal farmer coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.60,0:39:01.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你们肯定不会报价两万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.60,0:39:01.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}then you wouldn't be saying £20,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.64,0:39:04.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}哪个普通农民 会给拖拉机镀铬 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.64,0:39:04.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, what normal farmer would chrome his tractor, you pillock!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.64,0:39:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}真的不
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.64,0:39:07.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.32,0:39:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}考虑到距离开业只剩五个礼拜了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.32,0:39:13.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Since we were now only five weeks from opening,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.12,0:39:17.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我只能被迫答应巴顿斯的条件
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.12,0:39:17.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I was forced to agree to Buttons' terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.76,0:39:23.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过好消息是 苏和瑞秋帮我找到了一个主厨
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.76,0:39:23.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}On the good-news front though, Sue and Rachel had found me a chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.60,0:39:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他叫尼克 他和她们一样
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.60,0:39:26.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}His name was Nick, and like them,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.04,0:39:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在酒吧筹备和经营方面 有着丰富的经验
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.04,0:39:31.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}he had vast experience of getting pubs up and running.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.12,0:39:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你开过多少家酒吧 餐厅 十家
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.12,0:39:35.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How many pubs have you opened? Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.96,0:39:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你在斯特拉特福德有一家店 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.96,0:39:38.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-So you've got a place in Stratford? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.28,0:39:40.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但你可以过来帮我们把这家开起来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.28,0:39:40.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But you can come and help us get this one going?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.40,0:39:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 完全没问题 斯特拉特福德那家店
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.40,0:39:43.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh yeah, a hundred per cent. The place in Stratford runs...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.52,0:39:46.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}已经可以纯靠员工运营 我只需要监工
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.52,0:39:46.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, it runs with just me overseeing. At the moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.40,0:39:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}目前 令人不安的是 尼克跟着就指出
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.40,0:39:50.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Worryingly, Nick then pointed out that getting my pub open
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.20,0:39:54.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}要把我的酒吧开起来 其难度超过了他开过的所有酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.20,0:39:54.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}would be harder than any of the others he'd done in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.92,0:39:57.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}最让我担心的一个问题是
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.92,0:39:57.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What fills me with living dread
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.24,0:39:59.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们第一次沟通时
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.24,0:39:59.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}is the initial conversation I had with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.92,0:40:02.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你说你养了17头牛 你想把它们送到酒吧卖掉
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.92,0:40:02.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}is you have seventeen cows, you wanna sell them in the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.08,0:40:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}问题就在于如何卖掉这些牛
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.08,0:40:04.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's how we sell those cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.04,0:40:05.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.04,0:40:05.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.60,0:40:08.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不可能售卖牛的全身各个部位
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.60,0:40:08.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We can't sell them in all of their constituent parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.52,0:40:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么就不能
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.52,0:40:12.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Why can't we just, erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.12,0:40:16.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}假定每天有300到350人来这里用餐
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.12,0:40:16.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you're gonna serve 300, 350 people here in one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.16,0:40:21.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们无法准备二十份 所以你无法做牛心 牛舌
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.16,0:40:21.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we can't hold -twenty portions of shin of beef- So you can't do beef heart, ox tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.84,0:40:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}二十份牛腱 那样的话 菜单上会有一百道菜
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.84,0:40:25.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Twenty portions... We end up with a menu of a hundred dishes
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.36,0:40:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这绝对做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.36,0:40:27.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}which is like completely unachievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.68,0:40:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们的菜单要定期轮换 同一时间只供应牛的一个部位
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.68,0:40:31.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So on a regular rolling basis, we need to be serving one cut from a cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.92,0:40:33.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你打算如何处理剩下的部位
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.92,0:40:33.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, what are you doing with the rest of the cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.80,0:40:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等一下 我的老天爷 太复杂了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.80,0:40:37.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hold on. Oh, my God al-fucking-mighty. This is complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.16,0:40:40.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以如果我们宰了一头牛 把它送到肉店
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.16,0:40:40.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So if we slaughter a cow, take it to the butcher's...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.80,0:40:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在某一段时间内 我会大量需要
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.80,0:40:43.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What I'd want is parts of that cow in large quantities
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.08,0:40:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}牛的某个部位
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.08,0:40:45.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}for a finite period of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.12,0:40:48.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}比如这周我们只供应牛腰肉
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.12,0:40:48.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}For one week we'd be serving rump steaks,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.44,0:40:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以这周我只要牛腰肉
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.44,0:40:50.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}so for that week, all I want are rump steaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.80,0:40:53.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}下一周我们可以更换菜单 可以轮换
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.80,0:40:53.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The following week, we can change the menu, we can switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.88,0:40:56.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可以改为供应慢炖牛板腱
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.88,0:40:56.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We can move on to a sort of slow-cooked feather blade of beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.56,0:40:59.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过还是一样 下周我只要牛板腱
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.56,0:40:59.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But again, all I want for a week is the feather-blade cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.68,0:41:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}厨房的运作必须简单
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.68,0:41:03.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The kitchen operation has to be simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.60,0:41:05.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}必须尽可能快地上菜
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.60,0:41:05.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}People need to be served reasonably quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.84,0:41:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不仅顾客满意 对你的生意也有好处
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.84,0:41:08.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}both for their own enjoyment, but also for your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.08,0:41:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为了翻 对 让顾客吃完 然后翻台
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.08,0:41:10.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}To turn, yeah. You feed people, you turn the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.84,0:41:14.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我开始担心这个问题了 我原来想的是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.84,0:41:14.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This has really worried me now. Because I thought if we got
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.12,0:41:16.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}全国有五十个农民为我们供货
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.12,0:41:16.58,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}fifty farmers round the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.58,0:41:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们说 "我们会买下你们的牛肉"
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.58,0:41:18.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we say: "We'll take your beef."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.20,0:41:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.20,0:41:19.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.20,0:41:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的牛肉就足够五万人吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.20,0:41:22.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We'd have enough to feed fifty thousand people.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.40,0:41:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但其实我们只要一个部位
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.40,0:41:26.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But what we're actually doing is only taking one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.80,0:41:28.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的农场商店有一个汉堡贩卖车
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.80,0:41:28.62,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, at the farm shop with the burger van,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.62,0:41:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们把所有肉都做成肉馅
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.62,0:41:29.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we just mince everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.00,0:41:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 把一整块牛柳送进绞肉机
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.00,0:41:31.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Fillet, the whole lot goes in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.52,0:41:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对一家酒吧来说 这种做法没有商业可行性
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.52,0:41:35.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Which is not commercially viable in a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.32,0:41:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}任何一个酒吧老板 都不会把牛柳做成肉馅
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.32,0:41:38.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Nobody who owns a pub anywhere is mincing a fillet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.28,0:41:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是一种商业自杀行为 该死
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.28,0:41:39.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-It's commercial suicide. Fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.04,0:41:44.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那你是怎么处理牛的其他部位的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.04,0:41:44.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, but what actually do you do with the rest of the cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.16,0:41:44.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.16,0:41:44.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Exactly. Well, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.04,0:41:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在某种程度上 这不是我的问题 是你的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.04,0:41:48.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}To a certain extent that's not my problem, that's your problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.16,0:41:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为如何经营 需要你来拿主意
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.16,0:41:53.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because this is your idea of how to run the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.16,0:41:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我什么都不懂 拿的主意不靠谱
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.16,0:41:57.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah, but it's my idea based on absolutely no knowledge whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.12,0:42:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我意识到了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.12,0:42:00.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's becoming clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.44,0:42:05.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把你的牛从头到尾全部 放在酒吧出售
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.44,0:42:05.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The concept of serving the nose to tail of your cows in this pub
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.20,0:42:07.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个主意行不通
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.20,0:42:07.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}does not work.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.24,0:42:15.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}两周前 苏和瑞秋 抛给我一个棘手的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.24,0:42:15.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, two weeks earlier, Sue and Rachel had given me a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.64,0:42:17.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你们知道 我们打算把商店开在这里面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.64,0:42:17.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You know we're gonna put the shop in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.80,0:42:20.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么 丽莎的商店
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.80,0:42:20.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-What? Lisa's shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.20,0:42:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要那块空间 有很多东西要储藏
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.20,0:42:23.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We need that area. We've got so much to store.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.64,0:42:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 尼克又抛给我 一个更加棘手的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.64,0:42:28.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And now Nick had handed me one that was even bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.56,0:42:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我急需解决这些问题
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.56,0:42:33.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I urgently needed to sort these things out,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.80,0:42:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我没有时间
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.80,0:42:35.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but I didn't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.12,0:42:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}进去 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.12,0:42:37.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In you get. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.16,0:42:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我得赶回农场 为母牛称重
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.16,0:42:39.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because I had to get back to the farm to weigh the cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.00,0:42:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是磅秤 需要设置一下 新设置
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.00,0:42:43.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the weigh scales then, and you've set it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.48,0:42:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}从而确保新饲料让它们长胖了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.48,0:42:47.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}To make sure their new diet was making them fatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.48,0:42:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开始称重 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.48,0:42:49.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Start session. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.88,0:42:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}最适宜宰杀的体重是多少
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.88,0:42:52.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What's the ideal slaughter weight for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.20,0:42:54.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大概650公斤 好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.20,0:42:54.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Roughly between about six-fifty. Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.72,0:42:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.72,0:42:56.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.72,0:42:57.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（牛 体重 变化）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.12,0:42:57.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.12,0:42:57.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.48,0:43:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}耳标编号是多少 105386
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.48,0:43:04.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What's the ear tag? 105 386.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.96,0:43:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（耳标）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.28,0:43:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}体重是468公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.28,0:43:08.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And that one weighs... 468.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.12,0:43:10.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它瘦了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.12,0:43:10.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He's lost weight. Hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.64,0:43:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}随着称的牛越来越多 我逐渐意识到这不是个例
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.64,0:43:16.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}As the weighing went on, I realised this wasn't a one-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.28,0:43:17.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}体重是多少
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.28,0:43:17.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What was the weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.72,0:43:18.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}462公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.72,0:43:18.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Four six two.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.76,0:43:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它瘦了两公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.76,0:43:20.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He's lost two kilograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.12,0:43:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.12,0:43:22.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.44,0:43:23.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.44,0:43:23.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.04,0:43:27.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}472公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.04,0:43:27.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}472 kg.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.52,0:43:30.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 瘦了四公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.52,0:43:30.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, that's lost four kilograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.20,0:43:32.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么会瘦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.20,0:43:32.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Why are they losing weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.00,0:43:34.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.00,0:43:34.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.04,0:43:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}490公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.04,0:43:36.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Four ninety.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.08,0:43:41.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}只重了一公斤 十五天了 才重了一公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.08,0:43:41.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's only put on 1 kg. Fifteen days he's put on one kilogram.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.84,0:43:43.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.84,0:43:43.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, shitting hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.80,0:43:46.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}减了7斤 这头减了14斤 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.80,0:43:46.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Minus 7? Minus 14 there, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.64,0:43:50.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}继续走
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.64,0:43:50.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.48,0:43:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}短时间内 没有人会吃到它们的肉了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.48,0:43:53.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Nobody's gonna be eating these any time soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.56,0:43:54.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 这不是好事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.56,0:43:54.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No. That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.88,0:43:58.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我该拿你们怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.88,0:43:58.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What are we gonna do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.16,0:44:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它们想明白了 一旦长胖了 就会被送去市场
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.16,0:44:05.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They've worked out that if they get fat they go off to market.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.48,0:44:09.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}于是让自己患上了暴食症
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.48,0:44:09.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So they've given themselves bulimia.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.16,0:44:13.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}牛粪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.16,0:44:13.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.16,0:44:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}原来问题真的出在牛粪上面
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.16,0:44:17.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It turned out that shit actually was the issue,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.24,0:44:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}迪尔翁说 新的超级饲料 导致了它们拉肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.24,0:44:22.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because Dilwyn said their new superfood was giving them diarrhoea.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.88,0:44:26.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你喂了它们太多高能量饲料了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.88,0:44:26.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You're giving them too much high-powered food
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.72,0:44:28.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}吃完以后直接就拉出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.72,0:44:28.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and it's just basically going straight through them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.96,0:44:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就好比我吃了辛辣咖喱肉 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.96,0:44:31.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's like me having a vindaloo really.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.24,0:44:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你给它们喂的东西完全没用
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.24,0:44:32.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What you're feeding them isn't doing any good,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.00,0:44:34.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为吃完就拉出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.00,0:44:34.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause it comes straight out the backside.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.00,0:44:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 由于收割在即 我们去庄稼地里走了走
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.00,0:44:41.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Then, with the harvest looming, we went on a crop walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.12,0:44:44.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那里也是一场灾难
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.12,0:44:44.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And that was a disaster as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.32,0:44:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.32,0:44:46.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.20,0:44:48.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是鼻涕虫吗 该死
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.20,0:44:48.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that a slug? Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.56,0:44:49.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.56,0:44:49.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.72,0:44:51.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}情况不妙 确实不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.72,0:44:51.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's not good. That is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.64,0:44:53.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你的小麦长了麦角了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.64,0:44:53.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got ergot in your wheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.36,0:44:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是一种长在小麦上的致幻真菌
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.36,0:44:58.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That is a hallucinogenic fungus growing in the wheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.40,0:45:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}活见鬼了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.40,0:45:00.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, for fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.20,0:45:06.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我"勇敢"地让卡莱布和查理 去处理小麦上的"迷药"
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.20,0:45:06.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Bravely, I left Kaleb and Charlie to deal with the LSD in our wheat
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.00,0:45:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}以及得了暴食症的母牛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.00,0:45:08.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and our bulimic cows
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.48,0:45:11.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我自己回到了酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.48,0:45:11.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and went back to the pub
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.56,0:45:15.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}坐在阳光下 喝着啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.56,0:45:15.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to sit in the sunshine with a glass of thinking juice
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.36,0:45:18.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}想着如何解决那里的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.36,0:45:18.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to sort out the problems there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.80,0:45:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}终于 我想到了一个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.80,0:45:30.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And eventually, I had a brainwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.72,0:45:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}帐篷
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.72,0:45:36.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Tent!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.12,0:45:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要的是
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.12,0:45:38.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What was needed
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.32,0:45:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}给《壮游》中的威尔曼先生打个紧急电话
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.32,0:45:42.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}was an urgent call to The Grand Tour's Mr Wilman.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.48,0:45:44.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我叫他雷格 不要问为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.48,0:45:44.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I call him "Reg". Don't ask why.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.52,0:45:45.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}喂 雷格
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.52,0:45:45.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello? Reg?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.40,0:45:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.40,0:45:47.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.48,0:45:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}额
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.48,0:45:48.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.96,0:45:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道《壮游》中的帐篷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.96,0:45:50.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You know The Grand Tour tent?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.96,0:45:53.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.96,0:45:53.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.16,0:45:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道现在帐篷在哪儿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.16,0:45:55.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know where it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.32,0:45:57.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在一个仓库里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.32,0:45:57.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it's in a warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.04,0:46:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道 放在一个仓库里了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.04,0:46:00.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, it's tucked away in a warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.36,0:46:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说 我们找不到地方扔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.36,0:46:03.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, we can't get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.44,0:46:09.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一旦《壮游》中的巨大帐篷 在酒吧的草坪上支起来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.44,0:46:09.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}With the vast Grand Tour tent erected on the pub's lawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.28,0:46:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不仅丽莎的商店有地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.28,0:46:12.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we'd not only have somewhere for Lisa's shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.36,0:46:16.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还可以安放一间肉店 和安妮的汉堡贩卖车
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.36,0:46:16.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but also space for a butcher's and Annie's burger van,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.24,0:46:20.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这样我就可以卖掉 酒吧厨房不需要的牛肉了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.24,0:46:20.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}so I could sell the cuts of meat not needed in the pub's kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.76,0:46:23.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后可以转移到那里和那里 只需要一次操作
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.76,0:46:23.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We can then transfer it to there and there, all in the same operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.12,0:46:26.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 所以当牛送来时
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.12,0:46:26.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah. So when a cow comes here,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.60,0:46:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所有部位都能得到利用
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.60,0:46:27.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}all of it is used.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.56,0:46:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是正确的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.56,0:46:30.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the right direction, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.20,0:46:32.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你是指我刚才说的 是的 这个主意好 对
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.20,0:46:32.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What I'm saying? Yeah. That is good, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.00,0:46:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（两天后）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.44,0:46:45.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}《壮游》中的帐篷
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.44,0:46:45.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The Grand Tour tent!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.68,0:46:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我去 这么多帐篷
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.68,0:46:51.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a shitload of tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.40,0:46:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.40,0:46:53.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.68,0:46:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}都在这里了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.68,0:46:54.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that the whole thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.04,0:46:57.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 还有一车 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.04,0:46:57.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, there's another load to come. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.36,0:47:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}来 继续来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.36,0:47:02.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, keep coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.12,0:47:13.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在距离开业仅剩四周 我们总算是回到正轨了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.12,0:47:13.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, just four weeks before opening, we were finally back on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.48,0:47:22.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（下集预告）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.16,0:47:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.16,0:47:23.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.56,0:47:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开始
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.56,0:47:27.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.60,0:47:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}出发
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.60,0:47:28.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.76,0:47:31.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你觉得在烤肉店 挂一盏鹿角吊灯怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.76,0:47:31.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How do you feel about an antler chandelier in the carvery room?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.20,0:48:03.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}字幕翻译 刘波
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.28,0:48:05.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}创意监督 张珺怡
